{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The r5 checkpoint already supplies admission, the eval parser goal, and dynamic-scope recognition. The remaining bridge crosses module installation, runtime bindings, and the existing fatal lifecycle; I’m checking those interfaces together because an emitter that only runs in a test harness would not satisfy the caller-task and manifest-pinning requirements."}}
